    description: "STATEMENT\nA TypeScript or JavaScript method call on a receiver whose type is declared (a typed field, a typed variable, a value of a collection with a declared element type) is bound on that type, or left unresolved when the type is outside the repository; it is not bound to a same-named method of the caller's own file.\n\nOBSERVED (2026-11-25; blinded sample judged from source, ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/sample_11252026/results.md; TypeScript stratum same_file with one candidate in the file: 3 judged, 3 wrong, all evidence_type ast_method_inferred at confidence 0.66)\n- koel, resources/assets/js/services/QueuePlaybackService.ts:122 `this.media.pause()` -> QueuePlaybackService.pause. this.media is declared HTMLMediaElement (BasePlaybackService.ts:7): the DOM method.\n- workadventure, Phaser/Game/GameMap/GameMapFrontWrapper.ts:260 `entity.getCollisionGrid()` -> GameMapFrontWrapper.getCollisionGrid. entity is an Entity (EntitiesManager.getEntities(): Map<string, Entity>): Entity.getCollisionGrid, another file.\n- harbor portal, scanAll.service.ts:36 `this.scanApiRepository.postSchedule(param)` -> ScanAllRepoService.postSchedule (the calling method itself). scanApiRepository is typed ScanApiRepository: its abstract postSchedule.\nPopulation: 27 TypeScript and 35 JavaScript edges are in this stratum on the 51 trees, so the route is small; the mechanism (a method found by name in the caller's file whatever the receiver) is the same one WI-topit says the magnet detector cannot see (7,668 ast_method_inferred edges).\n\nALSO SEEN in the same sample: an import written with its `.ts` extension is not followed (hocuspocus tests: `import { sleep } from \"../utils/index.ts\"`, the call binds a file-local `sleep` of another test file; two of two). The JavaScript `.js` case is WI-lizis."  # 49a1
